{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess of doom is a chess-based roguelike where you're outnumbered at every turn. Harness the dungeon's power to battle enemy hordes, familiar and strange. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIE, LEARN, MASTER, CONQUER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges the player in a procedurally generated dungeon where every turn matters. Battle through rooms with twisted rules and challenges, facing classic and bizarre chess pieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE POWER WITHIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dungeon's power with souls and gambits. Souls grant unique move sets, letting the player  traverse the complex layouts and outsmart relentless foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 gambits to discover. Redefining strategies and bending game rules. Combine them to turn the tide in you favour!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650370?t=1753784298","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650370/915f6fd44b77297f216a4e498002d2097bd9d26c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753784298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650370/bb9e3240d8b8cdd40ddbcbf917f5884c76c5b8ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753784298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650370/bb9e3240d8b8cdd40ddbcbf917f5884c76c5b8ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753784298","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3781710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chess of doom is a chess-based roguelike where you're outnumbered at every turn. Harness the dungeon's power to battle enemy hordes, familiar and strange. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIE, LEARN, MASTER, CONQUER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges th